<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timote</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timote</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In Runtu kan Pathian ih thupeknak in le kan ruahsannak a si mi Khrih Jesuh zaarin Khrih ih tirhthlah a si mi keimah Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kan rinnak sungah ka fapa ngaingai a si mi Timote na hnenah ca ka lo kuat. Kan Pa Pathian le kan Bawipa Khrih Jesuh in ngilneihnak, zaangfahnak le daihnak lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Masidonia peng ka feh zawng ih ka lo fial zo bangin Efesa khua ah um dingin ka lo duhsakmi a si. Efesa khua ih thurin dik lo a zirhtu kha cubangtuk ih zirh nawn lo dingin va kham rori aw ti ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />El awknak lawng a suaktertu thuanthu menmen le cem thei lo ko ih rak nganmi an suahkehnak pupa hmin pawl uarnak khal hlon dingah sim hai aw. Ziangahtile cubangtuk pawl cun Pathian tumtahnak an kimter thei lo. Zumnak lawngin Pathian tumtahnak cu theih thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi bangtuk ih ka lo fial tikah ka tumtahmi cu, thinlung thiang sungin a rami duhdawtnak, le siaṭha thleidannak thinlung thiang le a felmi zumnak um seh ti duhnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi bangtuk hi mi hrekkhat cun an tlansan ih aat-thlak thu-el awknak sung an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ih daan thuhla ahcun zirhtu saya ṭuan an duh; asinain anmah ih simmi lala hman a tican an thei lo ih a theizet le lunghmuizet vekih an simmi thu khal an thei ngah ngaingai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daan cu a sinak ding vekih hmanah cun a ṭhami a si ti kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain kan ciin ding a ṭulmi cu, daan timi cu miṭha hrangih tuahmi a si lo; daan a buartu, miṭha lo, Pathian upatnak nei lo le mi sualral pawl, biaknak siseh thlarau lam siseh zianghman ih a siar lotu pawl, an nu le an pa a thattu pawl, laithat pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />cin le daan nei loih a nung pawl, mihur pawl, sal zuarnak in sumtuah pawl, thuphan per pawl, thu theihpitu dik lo pawl, cule thurin dik kalhkih ih a nungtu pawl, cu pawl hrangih tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cubangtuk zirh awknak cu than dingih i fialmi Thuthang ṭha sungah a um ih cuih Thuthang ṭha cu sunloih le upatin a ummi Pathian hnen ihsin a rami a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hnaṭuan ka ṭuan theinak ah thazaang i petu kan Bawipa Khrih Jesuh hnenah lungawi thu ka sim. Hlanah cun Amah cu ka simsia, ka hrem ih ka hmuhsuam ciamco naón,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah riantu dingah i hril ih a hnaṭuantu ding tlak ih i ruah ruangah ka thangṭhat a si. Pathian cu i zaangfahtu a si, ziangahtile zumnak zianghman ka rak nei lo ih ka tuahmi hi ziang a si ti hman ka rak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in a tamzetmi a zaangfahnak thawn i run burh ih zumnak le duhdawtnak i pek. Cuih zumnak le duhdawtnak cu Khrih Jesuh thawn kan pehzom awknak thawngin kan ta an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrih Jesuh cu misual pawl rundamsuak dingah leilung ah a rung ṭum, timi hi a dikmi ṭong a si ih famkim zetin pom tlak le zum tlak a si. Cuih misual pawl lakah kei hi misual bik ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian cu ka parah zaangfahnak a nei ih Khrih Jesuh a thinsaunak le a lungnemnak ka parih a langnak dingah a si. Cubangtuk in Khrih Jesuh lungnem thinsaunak kei misual bik miangmo parih a thlennak cu neh hnuah mi in amah an zum ih kumkhua nunnak an ngahnak dingih zohṭhim dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumkhua in Siangpahrang a si mi, thih ni nei lo, le mit-ih hmuh theih lo, amah lawng Pathian taktak a si mi, a hnenah upatnak le sunlawinak kumkhua in hmun camcin seh! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Timote, ka fapa, na tuah dingmi pawl na hnenah ka lo ap. Hitiih ka lo ap tikah a hlanah nangmah ih thu-ah profet ih a rak simmi thawn a kaih awmi a si. Cuih profet simmi pawl cu raldonak hriamnam ah hmang awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thinlung thiang nei in na zumnak fekter aw. Mihrek cu an siaṭha thleidan thiamnak thinlung an thlun duh lo ruangah an zumnak an siatter ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cubangtuk mi lakah Himenaias le Alexander tla an tel ih an pahnih in Satan kut sungah ka pek. Hi bangtuk ih ka tuahmi cu Pathian an simsiatnak reh seh tinak ah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hmaisa bikih ka lo fial duhmi cu mi hmuahhmuah hrangah Pathian hnenah thlacam uh, dil uh, midang ai-ah thlacam uhla lungawi thu sim uh, ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Daite le hnangamte ih kan um theinak dingah le Pathian ṭihzahnak thawn ziaza ṭha ih kan nun theinak dingah siangpahrang le ramsung hotu upa pawl hrangah thla cam uhla Pathian hnenah dil uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutiin nan tuah le a ṭha; cule mi hmuahhmuah thutak thei hai sehla, rundammi si hai seh ti a duhtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />in Rundamtu Pathian a lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian pakhat lawng a um ih minung le Pathian karlakah remnak tuahtu minung palai pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih palai cu mi hmuahhmuah tlen dingah a nunnak a petu Khrih Jesuh a si. Cutiin a nunnak a pekmi cu Pathian in a tikcu a kim tikah mi hmuahhmuah rundamsuak a duh, ti langternak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah a si zumnak thu le thudik phuangtu dingah Zentail mi hnenah tirhthlah le zirhtu-ah in thlah. Thuphan ka sim lo, thudik ka sim a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian biaknak hmun kipah mipa in thla cam hai seh ti ka duh. Pathian hnenah a pum a pe awmi thinhengnak le thu-el awknak um lotein mipa in an kut thlir in thla cam hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nunau khal a tawkzawn in um hai sehla zoh-mawi tawkin thuam aw hai seh. An sam an tom tikah a hleifuan in tom hlah hai seh; sui hlawnthil, lung mankhung le hnipuan mankhung zetzet thawn thuam aw hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuhnakin biaknak lamih a zuammi nunau an si ahcun ziaza ṭha in thuam aw sawn hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nunau cu a zirtu si hai sehla daite le tangdor tein zir hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zirhtu an si ding cu ka duh lo; mipa tlun khalah thu nei hlah hai seh. Daite in um hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangahtile a hmaisa bikih siammi cu Adam a si; neh hnuah Evi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule bum a tongtu cu Adam a si lo, Evi a si ih Pathian daan a buartu khal nunau a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nunau cu thinlung nemin an nung ih zumnak le duhdawtnak le thianhlimnak sungih an hnget ahcun fa an neihnak thawngin rundam an si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Zo khal in kawhhran hruaitu si a duh ahcun hnaṭuan ṭha duhtu a si,” timi hi thudik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawhhran hruaitu cu soiselnak nei lomi a si ding. Nupi pakhat lawng a neitu, rit theinak thil ih a suup aw theimi, a uk aw theimi, felfai zoh rem in a nungmi, mikhual a zohthiamtu le mi zirh a thiamtu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zurit hmangmi a si lo ding ih, thinsuup aw thei lo, midang thawn a to aw ṭheumi khal a si lo ding. Sikhalsehla mi lungnem le daihnak a duhtu a si ding. Tangka duh tukmi a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A innsang ṭhatein a ho theitu a si ding ih a faate pawl cu mi thu a ngaimi le mi upat thiammi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ih innsang hman ṭhatein a kilkhawi thei lo ahcun ziangtinso Pathian ih kawhhran a kilkhawi thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumnak lamah lungthleng pekte a si lo ding; culo ahcun a zum aw sual pang ding ih Satan cu hnon a rak ton vekin anih khal hnon a tong ve pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awi lo misenpi pawl ih an upatmi a si ding; cubangtuk a si lo ahcun mi ih relsiat a tong ding ih Satan ih thang ah a awk aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawhhran Upa pawl cu ziaza ṭha a neimi le ṭong tam lo thinlung tluangtlammi si hai seh. Zu in le tangka a duh tukmi an si lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih a run phuanmi thutak kha a siaṭha thleidannak thinlung thiangte in hngette ih a pomtu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Upa ṭuan a duh pawl cu hniksak hmaisa an si pei ih soiselnak um lo an si le an ṭuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An nupi khal ziaza ṭhami an si ding ih mi relsia ih ṭong tammi an si lo pei. Zu in lomi an si ding ih ziangtinkim ah mifel an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kawhhran Upa cu nupi pakhat lawng a neitu a si ding ih a innsang le a faate pawl ṭhatein a uk theitu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An hnaṭuan felteih a ṭuan theitu upa cu upat an co ih Khrih Jesuh an zumnak thu kha ralṭha zetin an phuang ngam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hnenih hi cakuat ka ngan laiah hin a rei hlanah ka ra lo tong cing ding tiin ka ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka tlai pang a si ahcun Pathian innsang a si mi kawhhran sungah ziang bangtuk in so kan umtlandan a si ding, ti kha hi ka cakuatmi in a lo sim ding. Pathian innsang cu kumkhua in a nungmi Pathian ih kawhhran a si ih cuih kawhhran cu thudik hramṭoh-nak le a dinhngettu ṭhuam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan biaknak sungih thuthup hi a tum ngaingai a si, ti cu zokhal in an el thei lo ding: Amah cu minung taksa in a suak, a dikmi a si thu Thlarau in a langter; Cule vancungmi khal in an hmu; A thuhla cu miphun zakip hnenah phuan a si ih leilung khuazakipah an zum. Cule sunlawinak ah lakso a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Caan neta lamah cun mihrek in Khristian thurin hi an taan ding; bumtu thlarau an zum ding ih khawsia ih zirhnak an thlun ding, tiah fiangtein Thlarau in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cubangtuk zirhnak cu thuphanper mibum thiam pawl in an zaiter. An siaṭha thleidannak thinlung cu thirling ih holh kangmi bangin a thimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih pawl cun nupa ṭhit awk le rawl hrekkhat ei tla a ṭha lo tiin an zirh. Sikhalsehla Pathian in cuih rawl pawl cu ei dingah a tuah ih Pathian a zumtu le thutak a theitu pawl hrangah cun lungawi thlacamnak thawn ei dingah a ṭhami a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu an ṭha ṭheh; zianghman hnon ding an um lo. Sikhalsehla ziang hmuahhmuah cu lungawi thlacamnak thawn cosaan ding a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ziangahtile Pathian ih thu le thlacamnak in a thiang ah a canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi zirh awknak hi Khristian kan unau pawl na sim a si ahcun Khrih Jesuh riantu ṭha na si ding. Nangmah khal na thlun rero zomi a dikmi thuzirhnak le zumnak ṭongkam ihsin thlarau lamah na cawm aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Pathian thu thawn pehtlaihnak zianghman a nei lomi simrel tlak lo thuanthu menmen pawl cu hrial aw. Pathian duhzawng ih nung dingin zirh-aw ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taksa harhdamnak ih zirmi cu man a nei ve ko naón thlarau harhdamnak hrangih zirmi cu ziangtinkim in man a nei. Ziangahtile atu-ah siseh, hmailam hrang khalah siseh, in tiamkammi cu nunnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiti ka simmi hi a dikmi ṭong a si ih zumtlak le cotlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rethei zet le harsa zetin hna kan ṭuan; ziangahtile kumkhua in a nungmi Pathian parah kan ruahsannak kan bun. Cuih Pathian cu mi hmuahhmuah Rundamtu a si ih amah a zumtu pawl hrangah a si hleice.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thlun dingmi le thuzirhnak pawl hi sim awla zirh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mino na si ruangah zohman in lo nautat hlah hai seh. Sikhalsehla na hmurka na ṭong daan, na umtlan na ziaza, duhdawtnak le zumnak le thianhlimnak khalah zumtu dang pawl ih zohṭhim dingin nung aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hnen ka ra thlen hlan sung cu misenpi hnenah Ca Thianghlim siar awla, thusimnak le thuzirhnak in na tikcu le na thazaang rak hmang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Profet pawl in thu an phuang ih upa pawl in na lu tlunih an kut an suan zawng ih na ngahmi thlarau laksawng kha thlahthlam hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ṭhanso zia kha mi hmuahhmuah ih an hmuhnak dingah himi pawl hi na tikcu le na thazaang pe in hmang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nundaan ralring awla na zirhmi tla ralring aw. Himi pawl hi cat loin tuah aw. Na tuah ringring thei a si ahcun nangmah le na thusimmi a theitu pawl kha na rundam ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa pawl kha va kawk hlah; na pa vekah ruat in neemte in forh hai aw. Mino deuh kha na unau-ah ruat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nunau upa deuh cu na nu bangtuk ah ruat awla, nunau no deuh pawl cu thinlung thiangte in na farnu bangtuk ah ruat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahte lawng khua a sami nuhmei pawl kha upat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nuhmei nu in faate a si lole tu a neih ahcun a hmaisabik ah cuih tu le fa pawl cun an nu le an pa, a si lole an pi an pu pawl kha an daanih a fial vekin kilkhawi hai sehla cawm ve hai seh. Ziangahtile cumicu Pathian lungawitertu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahte lawng khua a sami nuhmei cu, kilkhawitu zohman a neih lo ruangah, Pathian lawng a rinsan ih a sun a zanin thla a cam ih bomnak a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla tisa nomnak hrangih a taksa a hmangmi nuhmei cu a nung cingin a thi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nuhmei pawl cu zohmanih mawhthluk lomi an sinak dingah hi thuzirhnak pawl hi rak sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi pakhat cu a sungkhat, amah ih innsang sung hman kilkhawi loin zianghman ah a siar lo a si ahcun a zumnak a dungtun a si ih zum lotu hnak hmanin a sual sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziang bangtuk nuhmei hman kum sawmruk tlun a si lo ahcun nuhmei cazin sungah telh hlah. Cuih tlunah cuih nuhmei nu cu voikhat lawng pasal a neimi siseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnaṭuan ṭhatnak ah hmin a neimi siseh. Hnaṭuan ṭha timi ahcun: a faate a kilkhawi thiamtu, mikhual zoh thiamtu, hnaṭuan nauta bik kekholh khal Khristian unau parah a ṭuan zuamtu, harsat mangbang an ton caanah mi a bawmtu, le thilṭha tuah ah a tikcu le a thazaang a petu, timi pawl hi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nuhmei no deuh pawl cu nuhmei cazin sungah rak telh hlah. Ziangahtile pasal neih an duh sal tikah Khrih kha dung an tun ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuticun Khrih hnenih an thukammi an siatbal ih mawhthluk an tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Culawng si loin inn khat hnu inn khatah an vak ih a lakin an tikcu an cemter. Cu hnakih a sia sinsin cu: an ṭong a tam, mi an relsia, mi tinkim an tokhrok ih ṭong lo ding khal an ṭong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah kum no deuh nuhmei pawl cu pasal nei hai sehla faate tla nei in an inn kilkhawi hai seh ti ka duh. Cuti asile kan ral pawl in kanmah thangsiatnak caanṭha an ngah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangahtile nuhmei hrekkhat cu Satan thlun duh ah in tlansan zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Khristian nunau in a innsang ah nuhmei a neih ahcun kawhhran phurh ritter lo dingin amah in cawm seh. Cuti cun cawmtu nei loih khua a sami nuhmei taktak pawl kha kawhhran in a zoh thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kawhhran Hruaitu, hnaṭuan ṭha a ṭuantu cu ṭuan man a let hnih in ngah tlak an si. Cuih hruaitu lakah thusimnak le thuzirhnak ih a zuamzet pawl cun ngah tlak an si cuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim in, “Fang a ciil rerotu cawcang a hmur ṭem hlah,” a ti ih, “Hnaṭuantu cun a ṭuanman ngah ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thutheitu a mal bik pahnih tal an um lo ahcun kawhhran hruaitu mawh an puhnak cu ngai duh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sualnak a tuahtu pawl cu misenpi hmaiah kawk awla midang in an ṭih deuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian le Khrih Jesuh le a thianghlim vancungmi hmaika-ah ka lo fial: ziang na tuah khalle zohman thleidannak le duhdannak um lotein hi thuzirhnak pawl hi rak thlun aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnaṭuantu dingah zo par hmanah nawt-sa-ling in kutsuannak va tuah hlah. Midang tuahmi sualnak ah va tel hlah; thianghlim tein um aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tidai lawnglawng in loin na pum na le na nat dang nuam deuh dingah sabitti maltete in rak in aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat an sualnak cu fiangtein a lang ih thuṭhennak ah an sualnak cu anmah ih hlanah a thleng hmaisa; sikhalsehla midang sualnak cu neh hnupi lawngah a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cubangtuk in hnaṭuan ṭha cu fiangtein a lang ih a lang hrih lomi khal thuh-ralta a theih lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sal in a bawi cu upat pek tlak a si, tiin ruat seh. Cutiin a tuah asile zohman in kan Pathian hmin le kan thuzirhnak hi an relsia lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An bawi pawl Khristian an si tikah sal pawl in, “Khristian kan unau an si ve paam,” tiah hmuhsuam hlah hai seh. An hnaṭuan kha ṭha sinsin in an ṭuan ding sawn a si; ziangahtile an hnaṭuanmi ṭhathnemnak a cotu pawl cu an duhdawtmi zumtu pawl an si. Hi bangtuk in thu na zirh ding ih na sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zokhal kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih ṭong a dikmi le kan biaknak ih zirhmi thawn a mil-aw lomi thu mi a zirhtu cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zianghman thei hnai lo ih mi puarthau meen a si. Cupa cu ṭongfang pakhat thu khalah el awknak le tawh awknak a duh ih lungkim ti a nei lo. Cumi cun iksiiknak, thutamnak, mi nautatnak, mi zum lonak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />thutak a pom thei lomi le thinlung in thu a ruat thei tuk nawn lomi pawl thawn cat loih thu el awknak a suahter. Biaknak hi lennak lamzin pakhat a si tiin an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biaknak in minung cu a lianter taktak, a neihzat parih lungkimnak a neih phot ahcun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan suah pek laiah hi leilung parah ziangso kan suahpimi a um? Zianghman a um lo! Hi leilung ihsin kan ken theimi ziangso a um? Zianghman a um lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah ei ding rawl le hruk ding hnipuan kan neih ahcun kan hrangah a tawk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla len a duhtu pawl cu sualforhnak sungah an tla ih aat-thlak hna le ṭihnungza a si mi tisa duhnak thang sungah an awk aw. Cumi cun siatnak le hloralnak sungah a hnuk thla a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile paisa duhtuk cu sualnak phunkip thoktu hram a si. Mihrek cun paisa neih an duhtuk ruangah kan zumnak an tlansan ih riahsiatnak in voi tampi an thinlung a kuaiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nang cu Pathian minung na si ruangah himi pawl hi hrial aw. Dingnak, thianhlimnak, zumnak, duhdawtnak, tuartheinak le lungnemnak pawl nei dingah napi in zuam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zumnak hrangih do awknak ahhin na tha neih patawp suah aw. Theihpitu tampi mithmuh ah na zumnak felfai zetih na rak phuan tikah Pathian ih a lo kawhsannak a si mi kumkhua nunnak hi kai-hnget aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah nunnak a petu Pathian le Pontias Pilat hmaiih a zumnak felfai zetih a phuang theitu Khrih Jesuh hmaika-ah ka lo fial:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih a lang sal Ni tiang hi ka thupek pawl hi famkim le felzetin thlun aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih Ni cu, sunloih a si mi le amah pakhat lawng thil hmuahhmuah Uktu a si mi, siangpahrang lakih Siangpahrang bik, bawi lakih Bawi bik a si mi Pathian in, a khiah ciami caanah a kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah lawng hi thih ni nei lo Pathian a si; a ceennak hmun cu a tleu tuk ih zohman in an naih thei lo. Amah cu zohman in an hmu dah lo; zohman in an hmu thei lo ding. Kumkhua cahnak huham le upatnak cu a hnenah um camcin seh! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milian pawl kha, “Leilung thilri sumsaw nan neih ruangah puarthau ding a si lo,” tiah thu sim aw. Rinsan tlak lo leilung tlun lennak ah an ruahsannak bun ding a si lo; kan nomnak hrangah ziang hmuahhmuah siangzet in in petu Pathian ah bun sawn hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil ṭha tuah dingah le hnaṭuan ṭhatnak ah milian si sawn dingah le tirhsiangmi an si ih an neihmi kha midang hlawm siang dingah ralrinnak pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cu bangtuk in an thlun thei a si ahcun, hmailam hrangih hram ṭha a buntu an si ding ih ro sunglawi an khawl ding a si. Cuticun nunnak taktak cu an co suak ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timote, na kilkhawi dingah na kut sungih apmi hmuahhmuah kha himte in kilkhawi aw. Upat hmaizahnak zianghman tel lo, aat-thlak thu-el awknak, mi hrekkhat in “Fimthiamnak,” tiah a dik lo zawng ih an timi ṭong pawl cu hrial aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziangahtile mi hrekkhat in cumicu kan co ngah an ti ih zumnak lamzin ihsin an pial a si. Pathian zaangfahnak cu nan zate hnenah um hram seh.
  </para>
</usx>
